      "description": "tqdm\r\n====\r\n\r\ntqdm (read taqadum, \u062a\u0642\u062f\u0651\u0645) means \u201cprogress\u201d in arabic.\r\n\r\nInstantly make your loops show a progress meter - just wrap any iterable\r\nwith \u201ctqdm(iterable)\u201d, and you\u2019re done! Here\u2019s what the output looks\r\nlike:\r\n\r\n76%\\|\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\\ ````` ````` \\| 7641/10000 [00:34<00:10,\r\n222.22 it/s]",
